Third-party software
--------------------

Each dependency carries its own licence; go.mod and go.sum, and the console's
web/package-lock.json, record the versions used. The IMAP, MIME and SASL
layers build on the emersion projects (go-imap, go-message, go-sasl, go-smtp;
MIT), SMTP submission on github.com/wneessen/go-mail (MIT), the Model Context
Protocol server on github.com/modelcontextprotocol/go-sdk (Apache-2.0, with
earlier contributions under MIT), storage on modernc.org/sqlite
(BSD-3-Clause), which embeds SQLite (public domain), and backups on the AWS
SDK for Go v2 (Apache-2.0). The console's build bundles Vue (MIT).

